heric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Deep focus, unlocked.</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cardo:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Hide scrollbar for a cleaner look */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        body {\n            -ms-overflow-style: none;\n            scrollbar-width: none;\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        .font-serif-custom {\n 